{
  "short_id": "short304",
  "episode_id": "PD-2026-072-lacmegantic",
  "voice_stage": "master",
  "voice_id": "nPczCjzI2devNBz1zQrb",
  "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
  "estimated_cost_usd": 0.285,
  "total_seconds": 54.71,
  "master": "E:\\pd-media\\episodes\\PD-2026-072-lacmegantic\\06_voice\\master\\short304_vc_master_en_us_v002.mp3",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "L1",
      "chunk_id": "L1",
      "delivery": "intense",
      "text": "This was not a man skipping a check. The check was done. It was the check itself that could not fail.",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.805,
      "seconds": 5.805,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:0ae8d55f8ec1346297171851bfa4a607ecc85b278556b0eaae9f9dd6f2680df3"
    },
    {
      "id": "L2",
      "chunk_id": "L2",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "A parked train is held by two different things. The first is the air brake, which needs a running engine. The second is the hand brake.",
      "start": 6.025,
      "end": 13.177,
      "seconds": 7.152,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:a3342d5fcc38dca10b116f82b7fb46a654dfaf77608604cb80bc7d86e75819de"
    },
    {
      "id": "L3",
      "chunk_id": "L3",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "Hand brakes were applied to seven, out of a train of seventy-eight vehicles. The railway's own minimum, by the railway's own arithmetic, was nine.",
      "start": 13.397,
      "end": 22.081,
      "seconds": 8.684,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:54c464404be55c26404a5adfa8b7c03a6c79b6038cf7ef8860486bfedca4ef61"
    },
    {
      "id": "L4",
      "chunk_id": "L4",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "The investigation concluded that the real number was a minimum of seventeen, and possibly as many as twenty-six.",
      "start": 22.301,
      "end": 28.988,
      "seconds": 6.687,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:4d0e56c1ed5c87f341af9b1ac5044cf1f000f3faa533b747c52110d67ec11b19"
    },
    {
      "id": "L5",
      "chunk_id": "L5",
      "delivery": "calm",
      "text": "But none of that was left to judgement, because there was a test.",
      "start": 29.208,
      "end": 32.552,
      "seconds": 3.344,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:ac6c6341256c3e2d2a097f2bae91de2cd491e7a44d564784f734a7d234ce40f0"
    },
    {
      "id": "L6",
      "chunk_id": "L6",
      "delivery": "intense",
      "text": "The test was performed. It was performed with the independent brakes still active. So the thing holding the train during the test was not the thing being tested.",
      "start": 32.772,
      "end": 41.317,
      "seconds": 8.545,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:0c2f409be1c26648171a769cd15466457d9b6332c675230302a9ea68ae62ddee"
    },
    {
      "id": "L7",
      "chunk_id": "L7",
      "delivery": "intense",
      "text": "The train held. Of course it held. And because it held, nobody in that yard had any way of knowing that seven hand brakes were not enough.",
      "start": 41.537,
      "end": 49.432,
      "seconds": 7.895,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:09ad3734eb78e9c44a7ba234b92bf4d54c037c0347f83c556fbcb18b4979d007"
    },
    {
      "id": "L8",
      "chunk_id": "L8",
      "delivery": "calm",
      "text": "At the end of it, forty-seven people were dead, and eighteen separate things had gone wrong.",
      "start": 49.652,
      "end": 54.714,
      "seconds": 5.062,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:b4626ce4724ace9dad6a6c475d3f2dfa423b554bafe068e6409362371f6e0bd6"
    }
  ]
}
